            <TextArea editable="false" layoutX="845.0" layoutY="24.0" prefHeight="413.0" prefWidth="427.0" text="Netural DMG/DEF: 10-50/30 | Neutral DMG/DEF: 10-50/10&#10;Critical is 2x                           | Heal is 0&#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;Angry DMG/DEF: 30-60/0     | Angry DMG/DEF: 60-140/0&#10;Critical is   5x                         | Heal is 25&#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;Happy DMG/DEF: 0-40/10    | Happy DMG/DEF: 0-200/5&#10;Critical is 10x                         | Heal is 50&#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   &#10;Sad DMG/DEF:  5-30/100      | Sad DMG/DEF: 5-20/80&#10;Critical is 1.5x                        | Heal is 100&#10;                                              |   &#10;                                              |   ">
